---
// 日付（例: 2026.10.04）。日本時間で表示する（ビルド・配信の環境の時刻帯に左右されないように）
interface Props {
  date: string;
  class?: string;
}

const { date, class: className } = Astro.props;

const parts = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("ja-JP", {
  timeZone: "Asia/Tokyo",
  year: "numeric",
  month: "2-digit",
  day: "2-digit",
}).formatToParts(new Date(date));
const part = (type: string) => parts.find((p) => p.type === type)?.value ?? "";
const ymd = [part("year"), part("month"), part("day")];
---

<time
  datetime={ymd.join("-")}
  class:list={["tabular-nums text-muted-foreground", className]}
>
  {ymd.join(".")}
</time>
